- Invalid: The rotation status is abnormal. KMS cannot automatically rotate the secret.

> This parameter is returned only for ApsaraDB RDS secrets, PolarDB secrets, Redis/Tair secrets, RAM secrets, or ECS secrets.', example='Enabled'),
