- DryRunOperationError: The request would succeed if the DryRun parameter is not specified.
- ValidationError: The parameters specified in the request are invalid.
- AccessDeniedError: You are not authorized to perform this operation on the KMS resource.', example='false', position='Query'),
  keyId: string(name='KeyId', description='The ID of the key. You can also specify a key alias or key Amazon Resource Name (ARN). For more information about aliases, refer to [Manage key aliases](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/480655.html).
