This parameter is required.', example='key-hzz630494463ejqjx****', position='Query'),
  mac: string(name='Mac', description='The Base64-encoding message authentication code to verify.

This parameter is required.', example='vz1Snp+jGJbgydCFRWVWxAwIMdyfKCSp+jnMWQ==', position='Query'),
  message: string(name='Message', description='The original message data.  

